ular at the  beginning of  it than the end of it so you'll see the  crowds kind of dwindle as the tournament  goes along  i mean we'll still have a nice crowd for  the final four but it's all  about this first weekend  and as for new spots opening up virgin  hotels opens  this thursday and the link will open up  back to seven days a week starting on  monday reporting live on the las vegas  strip madison kimbrough 8 news now
 

